+	 * UARTs with integrated USI v2 registers (e.g. Exynos9820 UART_BT)
+	 * come out of reset with USI_CON.RESET set, which silently discards
+	 * every register write. Release it before the port is configured and
+	 * keep the IP clock requested for Rx, as the vendor driver does.
+	 */
+	if (platdev->dev.of_node &&
